WHAT THIS IS

This repository is public for two reasons: the arcade is served from it, and
anyone who wants to see how it is built can read it. Public is not the same as
free to use. No license is granted by this notice.


YOU MAY

  - Play the arcade wherever Effigy Media publishes it.
  - Read this source.
  - Keep a copy for your own private reference.


