ON THE GAMES THIS ARCADE DESCENDS FROM

Several machines on the Golden Era and Second Wave shelves are clean-room takes
on published arcade cabinets. The names, the artwork, the sounds, and the code
here are original to Effigy Media. No sprite, palette, level layout, character
design, or trademark of any other party is reproduced. This notice covers only
what Effigy Media made.


